:"....1...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"討價還價：「下次我每天多念一小時，是不是就能進步？」","n":26,"ssz":".............2....1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沮喪：「我可能就是讀書沒天分吧，覺得很沮喪。」","n":23,"ssz":".1...............1..1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接受：「雖然這次考不好，但我可以檢討下次再挑戰。」","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎情境三：家人決定要搬家，你要離開熟悉的學校和朋友。","n":26,"ssz":"......................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"否認：「應該只是說說吧，真的要搬嗎？」","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"憤怒：「為什麼家人都不問我的意見，太過分了！」","n":23,"ssz":"....1.....1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"討價還價：「如果我乖一點，爸媽會不會就留下來？」","n":24,"ssz":"..........2.....1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沮喪：「我很捨不得這裡的一切，覺得很孤單。」","n":22,"ssz":".1......1...11..1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].options.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接受：「搬家是新開始，雖然不捨，但我也可以交到新朋友。」","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎我面對失落，最常出現或最有印象的反應是：(勾選)","n":25,"ssz":"..................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"原稿只寫「(勾選)」沒寫單複選；因題幹說「最常出現或最有印象的反應**是**」而視為單選。","n":45,"ssz":"................................1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、調節「悲傷五階段」：這五階段不一定都會發生，有時候也反反覆覆，根據上一題答案，來看看你可以採取的調適策略。","n":55,"ssz":".................1..................2.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].columns[2]","slug":null,